EREBUS // access chain subsystem map
=====================================

  access_control/   badge/zone daemon (acctld) — operator CLI: zonectl
  chronicler/       station log/analysis journal — researcher-tier access
  _legacy/          decommissioned — not live

Tools:  zonectl status [user]
        zonectl grant <user> <zone>
        zonectl sync --sync-as <user> [--shell]     (recovery-only, see notes)

Logs:   /opt/station/modules/access_control/logs/zone_audit.log   (every zonectl invocation)
        /opt/station/modules/research_lab/logs/logactivity.log     (lab equipment diagnostics)

This chain assumes the same station foothold as the network chain: land on
`gh0st` (backdoor) or `controlsvc` (company-reclaimed), from /home there.
